    <bpmn:process id="W_W1384" name="W1384. Employee 13th Month Pay Computation, Proration &amp; BIR Taxable Benefit Reporting" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Scheduled — annual computation (November–December); ad-hoc for mid-year separations
Frequency: Annual (November computation, December payment); prorated at separation for each departing employee
Volume: ~6,918 employees across 5 entities (rank-and-file and management); ~720–960 prorated computations for separations
Owner: Payroll Manager
Participants: Payroll Officer, HR Specialist, Controller, BIR
Source: workflow W1384 — Employee 13th Month Pay Computation, Proration &amp; BIR Taxable Benefit Reporting</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1384_LaneSet5">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1384_Lane1" name="Payroll Officer">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1384_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1384_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1384_Task12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1384_Task13</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1384_Start6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1384_Lane2" name="Payroll Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1384_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1384_Lane3" name="Controller">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1384_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1384_Lane4" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1384_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1384_End14</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1384_Start6" name="Scheduled — annual computation (November–December); ad-hoc for mid-year separations">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1384_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1384_Task7" name="November: Payroll Officer runs 13th month pay computation in payroll system for…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: November: Payroll Officer runs 13th month pay computation in payroll system for all active employees: (a) total basic salary earned January 1 to November 30 (excluding overtime, night differential, hazard pay, and allowances per PD 851); (b) ÷ 12 = 13th month pay amount; (c) compare against PHP 90,000 tax exemption threshold; (d) compute taxable excess: 13th month pay − PHP 90,000 (if positive); (e) compute withholding tax on excess using graduated tax table
Responsible (R): Payroll Officer
Accountable (A): Payroll Manager
Duration: 2–4 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1384_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1384_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1384_Task8" name="Payroll Manager reviews computation: (a) spot-check 20–30 employee calculations…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Payroll Manager reviews computation: (a) spot-check 20–30 employee calculations for accuracy (especially employees with salary changes, leaves without pay, or mid-year hires); (b) verify exclusion of non-basic pay components (OT, allowances); (c) verify entity-level totals reconcile to GL salary expense
Responsible (R): Payroll Manager
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: 2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1384_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1384_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1384_Task9" name="Payroll Manager submits 13th month pay register to Finance Manager and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Payroll Manager submits 13th month pay register to Finance Manager and Controller for approval; Controller verifies total 13th month pay liability is accrued correctly in GL (accrued monthly per W9A month-end close)
Responsible (R): Controller
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: 1 hour</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1384_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1384_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1384_Task10" name="December payroll run: Payroll Officer includes 13th month pay in the December…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: December payroll run: Payroll Officer includes 13th month pay in the December 15 or December 20 payroll run (before December 24 deadline); tax-exempt portion (≤ PHP 90,000) posted as non-taxable benefit; taxable excess withheld at graduated rates
Responsible (R): Payroll Officer
Accountable (A): Payroll Manager
Duration: Part of payroll run</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1384_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1384_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1384_Task11" name="System posts 13th month pay through the W10.9 journal-import chain (unposted…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: System posts 13th month pay through the W10.9 journal-import chain (unposted batch under the Payroll PH source, validated and posted by GL): Dr. 13th Month Pay Expense (or Accrued 13th Month Pay if previously accrued) / Cr. Cash; tax withholding: Dr. 13th Month Pay Expense / Cr. Withholding Tax Payable
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1384_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1384_Flow22</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1384_Task12" name="Separation proration">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: Separation proration (ongoing): for each separated employee per W1383, Payroll Officer computes prorated 13th month pay: (a) total basic salary earned January 1 to last working day ÷ 12 = prorated amount; (b) if employee previously received partial 13th month pay (mid-year advance, if company policy allows), deduct prior payment; (c) include in final pay computation per W1383 step 5c
Responsible (R): Payroll Officer
Accountable (A): Payroll Manager
Duration: 5 min/employee</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1384_Flow22</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1384_Flow23</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1384_Task13" name="Year-end BIR reporting">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 7: Year-end BIR reporting: 13th month pay (including tax-exempt portion) is reported as part of employee&#x27;s annual gross compensation on BIR Form 2316 (Certificate of Compensation Payment/Tax Withheld); taxable excess included in taxable income; Payroll Officer generates 2316 forms for all employees per W9A year-end process
Responsible (R): Payroll Officer
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: Part of W9A</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1384_Flow23</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1384_Flow24</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1384_End14" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1384_Flow24</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W1384_Annotation15">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-300 (ensure controlled execution — Separation &amp; Benefits (PA-19.5).) | - operational: Payroll Manager review and approval gate; operational: periodic reconciliation against source documents
Owner: Payroll Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W1384_Assoc16" sourceRef="W1384_Annotation15" targetRef="W1384_Start6" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W1384_Flow17" sourceRef="W1384_Start6" targetRef="W1384_Task7" />
